            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change reflects the changes made to information about the  <code class=\"notranslate\">browser_specific_settings</code> and extension ID in the Extension Workshop updates:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2129\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2129/hovercard\">Clarify how other browsers handle the BSS key</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"802645734\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/2129\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/2129/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/2129\">#2129</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2125\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2125/hovercard\">Use @name formatting for add-on IDs</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"802499890\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/2125\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/2125/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/2125\">#2125</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note: Changes to the web extension ID format recommendation have not been applied in cases where the value reflects that in the source example, .e.g. <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/Native_messaging\" rel=\"nofollow\">Native messaging</a></p>",
