            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96347576?u=798adeac17b0340c3666d020c6f3391d71339849&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated the touch events example to use a standard for loop instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">touches.entries()</code> ensuring compatibility with modern browsers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change fixes a bug where the example didn't work in some browsers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/96347576/471103749-f7f2a2c2-2a47-4a54-afe5-b4e01577e89e.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..X9-7MI_DYXfbGupobf-XaIXSgUbnYdB_LkiygJc6elA\"><img width=\"665\" height=\"764\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/96347576/471103749-f7f2a2c2-2a47-4a54-afe5-b4e01577e89e.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..X9-7MI_DYXfbGupobf-XaIXSgUbnYdB_LkiygJc6elA\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 764px;\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40532.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3263265788\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40532\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40532/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40532\">#40532</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
