        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR primarily updates the \"See also\" of web browser glossary pages (Safari, Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Opera, and IE) to add cross-references between all browser entries.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Inspired by the links in Safari's <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Apple_Safari#see_also\" rel=\"nofollow\">See also</a> section, this PR adds similar links to \"See also\"s on Chrome and Firefox pages.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To make the relevant pages discoverable from any and all browser glossary pages.</p>",
