        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This fixes up the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCInboundRtpStreamStats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCInboundRtpStreamStats</code></a> to match the BCD as per FF142, which adds support for some more properties.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Contributes to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1628555901\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/384\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/384/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/384\">mdn/mdn#384</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249075657\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40478/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\">#40478</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removals (not in BCD): <code class=\"notranslate\">averageRtcpInterval</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">firCount</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">lastPacketReceivedTimestamp</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">packetsDuplicated</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">packetsFailedDecryption</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">perDscpPacketsReceived</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">pliCount</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">receiverId</code>,  <code class=\"notranslate\">sliCount</code>,</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40495",
            "title": "Ff142 RTCInboundRtpStreamStats fixes",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-25T07:12:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T06:15:44.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for the remaining mandatory properties of  <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats</code>: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/totalRoundTripTime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.totalRoundTripTime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/currentRoundTripTime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.currentRoundTripTime</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceCandidatePairStats/responsesReceived\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceCandidatePairStats.responsesReceived</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1371391\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1371391</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and a docs typo fix.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249073360\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40476\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40476/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40476\">#40476</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40492",
            "title": "FF142 RTCIceCandidatePairStats mandatory properties - relnote",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-22T03:43:21.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-22T03:41:19.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">If found the description of the CSP sandbox value <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-same-origin</code> to be a little confusing. This rewords to match the pattern of the other values, and adds the note that the <code class=\"notranslate\">Origin</code> header will be null if this is not set.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This fell out of reviewing <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3179678765\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40093/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40093\">#40093</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40094.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3179717797\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40094\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40094/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40094\">#40094</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40489",
            "title": "CSP sandbox allow-same-origin - clarify",
